            "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4474080/extras/bc4eb562f66cdf4876c218d5e77a2c23.avif?t=1787223018\" width=780 height=228 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4474080/extras/d7e8868f2575f50eb8e22d9a959d1f30.webp?t=1787223018\" width=780 height=54 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Please, Come Inside - Tavern Survival Simulator</strong> Manage your time and resources to stay alive. Work the night shift: serve guests, clean up, and cook in engaging mini-games. Earn gold to pay off the Count—otherwise, his bouncers will take your girls, or perhaps even your life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Prophecy and Seductive Guests</strong> An ancient prophecy states that a hero destined to save the world will appear here. Rumors have spread to every corner of the universe, drawing a diverse array of beauties and exotic races to your tavern. Enjoy the variety of forms and personalities, but stay vigilant—behind the mask of innocent beauty often lurks a cunning succubus ready to drain you dry.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4474080/extras/05fff3f9e92d4718366cbe28d476b069.webp?t=1787223018\" width=780 height=54 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Erotic Inspections and Investigations</strong> Use the daytime to study your guests. Your task is to distinguish innocent maidens from disguised succubi. Conduct detailed inspections: check their  body parts for signs of corruption. A correct choice sends the sinner to the dungeon, but a mistake leads to the cult destroying all your lodgers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4474080/extras/2e3da9132231f64884842912111a7e41.webp?t=1787223018\" width=780 height=54 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Building and Management</strong> Develop your tavern by opening new rooms. Build a VIP Hall for income, a Bathhouse for relaxation, and an Infirmary to resurrect victims of the cult. Every upgrade is a step towards safety—or new pleasures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Romance, Intrigue, and &quot;Bad&quot; Endings</strong> Build relationships with characters ranging from your elf assistant to mysterious guests. Your dialogue choices shape the plot. Don't worry if you make a mistake—losing can lead to unique and hot scenes with antagonists or the cult that are impossible to see during a &quot;correct&quot; playthrough.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4474080/extras/ecf1aa7b8ff16b49f98f56568000d7d2.webp?t=1787223018\" width=780 height=54 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >❖ <strong>Unique inspection mechanic:</strong> search for succubi signs by undressing characters. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >❖ <strong>Tavern Management:</strong> build and upgrade rooms to ensure survival and unlock new pleasures.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >❖ <strong>Character Relationships:</strong> unlock new girls and access steamy encounters by deepening your bonds.   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >❖ <strong>Day and night cycle:</strong> work and upgrade your tavern by day, and meet gorgeous girls by night.     </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >❖ <strong>Atmospheric tavern keeper sim</strong> with room navigation and hidden events.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4474080/extras/e3fe4c660fd34678b93f00ae855c70cd.avif?t=1787223